{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"screen\": \"我到底在气谁 又在想谁\",\n      \"source\": \"心里明明有东西，却还分不清这份不平静究竟是愤怒、遗憾还是怀念——这是一种尚未找到对象、也尚未找到语言的失落。\",\n      \"type\": \"5\",\n      \"severity\": \"严重\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿强调情绪尚未找到对象，屏幕稿却具体化为对某个“谁”的愤怒和思念，增加了明确的人际指向。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"screen\": \"开头的试探又把问题递回来：我究竟要怎样继续生活\",\n      \"source\": \"如果把这次回返听成心理上的回望，开头的试探姿态仿佛把问题重新递回来：“那么，我究竟要怎样继续生活？”\",\n      \"type\": \"2\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿把心理回望明确标为一种可选听法，屏幕稿删去条件和“仿佛”，将可能的解释写成了确定的解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"screen\": \"心跳像一下子被推到最高处\",\n      \"source\": \"密集的音符又像狂飙的激流向天空喷涌，仿佛一颗心脏以最高负荷跳动。\",\n      \"type\": \"7\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿把心脏最高负荷的比喻放在柔软歌唱进入宏大高潮的段落，屏幕稿却将它放到后面的快速八度段，改变了对应的音乐时点。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1ae793dc-6e72-4443-9e0f-5865d299fece", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T181556660513Z", "elapsed_seconds": 249.516, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T18:20:06.197270+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fec80d7b98b63b999226535d9fa74642c942dd5b0af570c349b7a3f152e0eea0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connec